<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-effects="on">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="使用 Linux.do 账号登录不许涩涩机场塔台-允许起飞。" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#070907" />
    <title>登录 · 不许涩涩机场塔台-允许起飞</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/logo.png" type="image/png" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/logo.png" />
    <script src="/assets/theme-bootstrap.js?v=20260809-4"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css?v=20260829-1" />
    <script src="/assets/vendor/simplewebauthn-browser.js?v=13.3.0" defer></script>
    <script src="/assets/vendor/qrcode.js?v=1.5.4" defer></script>
    <script src="/assets/login.js?v=20260821-1" defer></script>
    <script src="/assets/app-download.js?v=20260829-1" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body class="login-page">
    <div class="ambient-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="login-page-shell">
      <header class="login-header">
        <a class="brand" href="/login" aria-label="不许涩涩机场塔台-允许起飞登录页">
          <img class="brand-logo" src="/assets/logo.png" alt="" width="256" height="256" decoding="async" />
          <span class="brand-name">不许涩涩机场塔台-允许起飞</span>
          <span class="brand-version">/ 3.0</span>
        </a>
        <div class="login-header-actions">
          <button
            class="icon-button theme-toggle"
            id="theme-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-label="切换到日间模式"
            title="切换到日间模式"
            aria-pressed="false"
          >
            <svg aria-hidden="true"><use id="theme-toggle-icon" href="#icon-sun"></use></svg>
          </button>
          <span class="login-security"><i aria-hidden="true"></i> SECURE ACCESS</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main class="login-main">
        <img
          class="login-character-background"
          src="/assets/login-character.png?v=20260809-2"
          alt=""
          width="1536"
          height="1536"
          decoding="async"
          aria-hidden="true"
        />
        <aside class="login-app-qr" aria-label="扫码下载 Kan Mobile">
          <a class="login-app-qr-link" href="/app-download">
            <span>APP DOWNLOAD</span>
            <canvas
              id="login-app-qr-canvas"
              data-app-download-qr
              width="104"
              height="104"
              role="img"
              aria-label="打开 App 下载页面的二维码"
            ></canvas>
            <strong>扫码下载 App</strong>
            <small>Android 最新版 / iOS 资讯</small>
          </a>
        </aside>
        <section class="login-panel" aria-labelledby="login-title">
          <p class="login-eyebrow"><span>MEMBER ACCESS</span><i></i><span>18+</span></p>
          <img class="login-logo" src="/assets/logo.png" alt="" width="256" height="256" />
          <h1 id="login-title">登录机场塔台</h1>
          <p class="login-description">登录后可访问导航目录，并在所有设备同步你的站点收藏。</p>
          <div class="login-notice">
            <strong>成年访问确认</strong>
            <span>继续登录表示你已年满 18 周岁，并确认所在地区允许访问此类内容。</span>
          </div>
          <p class="login-message" id="login-message" role="status" hidden></p>
          <label class="login-cdk-label" for="login-cdk-code">CDK 激活码</label>
          <div class="activation-code-field login-cdk-field">
            <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-key-round"></use></svg>
            <input
              id="login-cdk-code"
              type="text"
              inputmode="text"
              autocomplete="one-time-code"
              autocapitalize="characters"
              spellcheck="false"
              maxlength="32"
              placeholder="老用户可留空"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="login-cdk-hint">新账号或待重新激活账号请先填写 CDK。</p>
          <a class="linuxdo-login-button" id="linuxdo-login-button" href="/auth/linuxdo">
            <span class="linuxdo-mark" aria-hidden="true">L</span>
            <span>使用 Linux.do 继续</span>
            <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-arrow-up-right"></use></svg>
          </a>
          <div class="login-method-divider" id="login-method-divider" hidden><span>已有 Passkey</span></div>
          <button class="passkey-login-button" id="passkey-login-button" type="button" hidden>
            <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-key-round"></use></svg>
            <span>使用 Passkey 登录</span>
            <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-arrow-up-right"></use></svg>
          </button>
          <p class="login-privacy">本站保存公开资料、会话、收藏、可选的 Passkey 公钥凭据及最近 90 天的视频/直播打开记录；匿名日聚合保留 400 天，不保存 Linux.do Token。</p>
          <section class="login-mobile-app-download app-download-component" data-app-download aria-labelledby="login-mobile-app-title">
            <div class="login-mobile-app-heading">
              <span>APP DOWNLOAD</span>
              <strong id="login-mobile-app-title">手机客户端下载</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="app-download-options">
              <article class="app-download-option app-download-option-android">
                <span class="app-download-platform-mark" aria-hidden="true">A</span>
                <div class="app-download-option-copy">
                  <span>Android</span>
                  <strong>最新 APK</strong>
                  <small data-android-status>正在获取最新版本...</small>
                </div>
                <a
                  class="app-download-action"
                  id="login-android-download"
                  data-android-download
                  aria-disabled="true"
                  tabindex="-1"
                >Android 下载暂不可用</a>
              </article>
              <article class="app-download-option app-download-option-ios">
                <span class="app-download-platform-mark" aria-hidden="true">i</span>
                <div class="app-download-option-copy">
                  <span>iOS</span>
                  <strong>尽情期待</strong>
                  <small>如果佬友能够帮助打包到TestFlight, 请在L站联系我</small>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer class="login-footer">
        <span>不许涩涩机场塔台-允许起飞 / AUTH GATEWAY</span>
        <span>SECURE SESSION · 2026</span>
      </footer>
    </div>

    <dialog class="activation-dialog" id="activation-dialog" aria-labelledby="activation-title" aria-describedby="activation-description">
      <form class="activation-form" id="activation-form">
        <p class="activation-eyebrow">FIRST FLIGHT / CDK REQUIRED</p>
        <div class="activation-heading">
          <span class="activation-key" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg><use href="#icon-key-round"></use></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h2 id="activation-title">激活新账号</h2>
            <p id="activation-description">该 Linux.do 账号首次进入，需要一个未使用的 CDK。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="activation-user">
          <span class="activation-avatar-wrap">
            <img class="activation-avatar" id="activation-avatar" alt="" hidden />
            <span class="activation-avatar-fallback" id="activation-avatar-fallback" aria-hidden="true">U</span>
          </span>
          <span>
            <strong id="activation-display-name">Linux.do 用户</strong>
            <small id="activation-username">@user</small>
          </span>
        </div>

        <label class="activation-code-label" for="activation-code">CDK 激活码</label>
        <div class="activation-code-field">
          <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-key-round"></use></svg>
          <input
            id="activation-code"
            name="code"
            type="text"
            inputmode="text"
            autocomplete="one-time-code"
            autocapitalize="characters"
            spellcheck="false"
            maxlength="32"
            placeholder="CFNAV-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX"
            required
          />
        </div>
        <p class="activation-status" id="activation-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

        <div class="activation-actions">
          <button class="activation-button activation-button-secondary" id="activation-switch-account" type="button">更换 Linux.do 账号</button>
          <button class="activation-button activation-button-primary" id="activation-submit" type="submit">
            <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-arrow-up-right"></use></svg>
            激活并进入
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </dialog>

    <svg class="icon-sprite" aria-hidden="true">
      <symbol id="icon-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.42 1.42M17.65 17.65l1.42 1.42M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.93 19.07l1.42-1.42M17.65 6.35l1.42-1.42"></path>
      </symbol>
      <symbol id="icon-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M20.8 15.2A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8.8 3.2 8.5 8.5 0 1 0 20.8 15.2Z"></path>
      </symbol>
      <symbol id="icon-arrow-up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path>
      </symbol>
      <symbol id="icon-key-round" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="4.5"></circle><path d="m10.7 12.3 8.8-8.8M15 8l2 2M17.5 5.5l2 2"></path>
      </symbol>
    </svg>
  <script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/v31edd6df95cf4e85bb4c19e7a9bdbcba1788362987495" integrity="sha512-iIg7k2xntmwu6/uSb5tpc/hySgZc4eoL31yB29W6tJFo2akwjPWcEqnCEdJvGexCL0KEQwVYv5BlowfhVz26hg==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"517aa3cd552c431eb6e864024c2767e4","r":1,"spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
<script>window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a3cb9dbfea585396',t:'MTc4OTY4NDg2Mw==',u:'01a0b187d43c7047bf0f2e4189635801',ut:'pEQ60xy1Ved7kXA27APAewAe41vUQ1v0.krbpxPrJV8-1789684864-1.2.1.1-vdYXrBWNRnKmKviS.jD0RCyF_A.tYY52AIShSUM07IfCns3NNRyQyi3UFrRXV1guTs_aI8UBTDf9BmBqeXk_9Mobmvin6lEN5XNb0KtBbgk',i:60};(function(){if(!document.body)return;var s=document.createElement('script');s.src='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/precursor/main.js';document.head.appendChild(s);})();</script></body>
</html>
